title: 종강총회_양나현_영문
---
<<show hyun_smile>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
NaHyun: Oh, you actually collected all the tickets?
NaHyun: How did you even manage to get 30 of them?
{name()}: It was a piece of cake.
{name()}: I just really wanted to get on this ride.
NaHyun: Do you like bumper cars?
{name()}: Yeah.
{name()}: I've always been a "best driver" type of guy.
NaHyun: Well, then...
NaHyun: Would you want to ride together?
{name()}: Huh?
NaHyun: I want to be in the car you're driving.
{name()}: For real?
NaHyun: Yeah. I'm hopeless when it comes to driving.
{name()}: Sure, let's ride together then.
(We chatted as we waited for our turn.)
(When it was finally our time to enter, NaHyun grabbed my hand.)
<<show hyun_spec>>
NaHyun: I want to ride that red one!
{name()}: !!
NaHyun: Hurry up!
{name()}: Slow down!
(We successfully made it into the red car NaHyun wanted.)
(We sat down and buckled our seatbelts.)
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: I'm looking forward to this drive.
{name()}: You got it. Just trust the "best driver."
(The ride started with the staff's signal.)
{name()}: Here we go!
(NaHyun gripped her seatbelt tightly.)
(I stepped on the pedal and zoomed around for a lap.)
(Right then,)
<<play 공통_쾅>>
...BAM!!!
<<show hyun_shock>>
NaHyun: Eek!!
{name()}: !!!
(A blue car slammed into us from behind.)
(The car shook violently from the impact.)
<<show hyun_neg>>
NaHyun: Let's go after that car and get revenge.
(I saw a spark of competitive fire in NaHyun's eyes.)
{name()}: Alright, you got it.
{name()}: Hold on tight.
(With the sole mission of getting revenge on that blue car, I floored the pedal.)
(Carefully steering to avoid other cars,)
(Finally, the gap between us and the blue car was...)
(10 centimeters!!!)
<<play 공통_쾅>>
...BAM!!!
(I slammed into the blue car as hard as I could for revenge.)
(At that moment,)
(As the car jolted from the impact,)
(NaHyun leaned her shoulder gently against mine.)
NaHyun: That was a perfect revenge.
<<show hyun_smile>>
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
(NaHyun was laughing.)
(She looked completely satisfied.)
{name()}: I'm glad you liked it.
NaHyun: Now, give me a smooth drive without any more bumping.
{name()}: Roger that.
(The ride didn't last very long,)
(But for the remaining two minutes, we enjoyed a perfect drive without hitting a single car.)
(After parking neatly, the staff announced the end of the ride.)
(Just before unbuckling and getting out, our eyes met.)
NaHyun: You really are a "best driver."
NaHyun: Should we take a picture before we get out?
NaHyun: To remember this.
{name()}: Sounds good.
(NaHyun pulled out her phone and switched to selfie mode.)
NaHyun: Do a "V." Peace sign~
<<cheese 종강총회_양나현2_영문>>
